  choices = $EXPL$["The right to manage daily operations and direct the corporation''s business activities","The right to vote on major corporate matters, receive declared dividends, and inspect corporate books and records","The right to bind the corporation in contracts with third parties as an agent","The right to transfer or encumber corporate assets without board approval"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under MBCA Sections 7.21 and 7.28, shareholders have the right to vote on major corporate matters (director elections, mergers, charter amendments), receive dividends when declared, inspect books and records, and receive residual assets upon liquidation. These rights define the ownership stake without conferring management authority.
